{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_06_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_06","title":"黃金三角","storyCode":"GT-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"83119d87f164b71e135fce2e0456b1456b73e2642f9b94f1ffbf657bce53735a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，果然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"鮑勃！你，你在流血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能在這裡白白流血！我還能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"鮑勃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我們流過的血還少嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"還要打嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我們為了活命而戰鬥，為什麼要在戰鬥中送命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我不夠強，我認命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"鮑勃，抱歉......沒有這箱寶藏，我們的村子就完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"離那箱東西遠一點。把鑰匙交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，嗚?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"在你用那把鑰匙打開寶箱的一瞬間，你會沒命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是家裡歷代流傳的貴重物品，父親說我們最重要的職責之一就是要負責保管這枚鑰匙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——鑰匙使用後會割破你的手，吸走你的血。如果不是你這樣的庫蘭塔人的血的話，鑰匙就毀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"把鑰匙給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，這是村子裡的所有人的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是真的嗎，斯卡蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"藏匿了騎士寶藏的人，為了守護騎士的秘密，不擇手段。只有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"——只有來自卡西米爾的血脈才能破除所有的阻礙。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"“只有來自不懼犧牲，無畏艱險的卡西米爾血脈才能破除所有的阻礙。”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然也知道可能會要付出一些代價，但沒有想到結果會是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"為了村子的所有人，我也早就做好覺悟了。我必須打開這個箱子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，如果我出了意外，請把這些寶藏換來的錢帶回給村民們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，父親......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可蘿爾。能把鑰匙給我看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"這個鑰匙也不是很大不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然它不大，但是它吸走的血液量，一般人恐怕撐不住——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這個怪物鑰匙，吸走的血是有限的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可蘿爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我來打開箱子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？可是這樣一來，格拉尼你就。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了，可蘿爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂啊，如果我暈過去了的話，請接住我的身體哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼你快住手！別這麼做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_med"},{"type":"narration","text":"數日後\n晴 \\ 能見度 12公里\n賞金獵人營地外"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們是......你們竟然還敢回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"集合！所有人都給我過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"真是麻煩，為什麼我要來幫忙處理這些賞金獵人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，既然你得到了鑰匙，就要幫我做這件事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"其實之前只要有你在，也就不用雇傭其他的人來幫助村子了不是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。明明不關我的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"人數不少。才剛撿回一條命的你，能對付得過來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不是還有你在嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac01_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"動作快點。我趕著回羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那麼動手吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可蘿爾還在等我們呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，最後還是沒能幫上忙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，村子裡的人也害怕感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情只有我們自己知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"總之,謝謝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你和格拉尼做這個決定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"所以這個事情終於告一段落了嗎，我要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，等等我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，可蘿爾！我們先回村子吧，村子還有好多事情需要我幫忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，鮑勃大叔，要保重身體！需要治療的時候，記得來羅德島！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"小個子，等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"這枚金幣，接好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我會好好珍惜這份紀念品的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"數月後\n【大鮑勃的信件】\n敬啟。\n我是鮑勃。\n我正在哥倫比亞的一處偏僻的莊園裡，給你寫下這封信。\n大家都過得很好。感染者的身份還是有些不便，但陽光下的生活，比想像中還要美好。\n多虧那個叫可蘿爾的小姑娘和格拉尼在修繕完村子後，決定把多餘的寶藏都留給我，我才能夠順利給這批弟兄們安居。\n我們已經可以自給自足了，甚至還打算試種啤酒花。\n這多虧了滴水村的那筆寶藏。\n那是一個有趣的故事，十分有趣。不是應該潦草地寫在信裡的故事。\n我稍微改變了一點想法。\n而我知道，你很早就有了自己的想法，整合運動並不是感染者唯一的歸宿。\n你一定可以做出你自己的選擇。\n我很想念你，希望能在哥倫比亞見到你。\n鮑勃\n致   泥岩"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_011","isRemote":false,"text":"那真是太好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動"]},{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
